 is written. ReLU on each group's part would throw away negative parts that later groups could outweigh.</p>","type":"order","steps":["The four banks and the weights are read at the address.","Each lane multiplies the values in its word by their weights and adds the products.","The four lanes' sums join the running total.","After the last group of taps, the bias is added and ReLU applied.","The result is written to the next layer's map."],"shuffled":[3,4,2,1,0]}]